  "boundary": "This plan prepares local-first representative performance measurement for the frozen historical dev.47 source under V1.7.1 Development. Hosted CI validates only the control plane and must not be treated as performance evidence. Frame pacing, input latency, and performance remain unverified until a reviewer-approved representative environment produces exact-source measurements meeting every approved budget threshold and a separate durable accepted record is governed into the retained working set. Energy behavior remains outside this tranche because it requires energy plus device evidence."
